<Simple lang="en" title="About" description="The Meowpany is a software studio in Montevideo, Uruguay, building for small businesses and teams abroad." lead="We are a software studio in Montevideo, Uruguay. We build for small businesses and for teams abroad, with clear prices and direct communication.">
  <h2>Mission</h2>
  <p>Build websites, online stores and custom software that help businesses sell more and work better, with clear prices, kept deadlines and close support.</p>
  <h2>Values</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> fixed quotes and visible progress.</li>
    <li><strong>Quality:</strong> tested, secure, documented code.</li>
    <li><strong>Reliability:</strong> we keep the date we promise.</li>
    <li><strong>Continuous learning:</strong> including applied AI.</li>
    <li><strong>Responsibility:</strong> we look after our clients' data.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Technology</h2>
  <p>We pick the technology for the problem, from e-commerce platforms to web apps, integrations and AI automation. What stays the same is the process: a specification, testing, documentation and version-controlled code.</p>
